{
  "_doc": [
    "Taxonomy for the unified place table (migration 034, area_analytics/places_unified.py).",
    "categories: our category key -> OSM tags, grouped. 'k=v' pairs joined by ';'; 'v1|v2' accepts either value from OSM (the first is written for other sources).",
    "OSM places get the most specific category whose tags they carry; an unlisted shop/office/craft/healthcare value falls back to the generic key of that tag.",
    "Mapping values: 'key', 'key;cuisine=x' (extra tags) or null (drop the place). Overture: exact category, then suffix/prefix rules, alternates, basic_category.",
    "Foursquare: full label ('Top > Sub > Leaf'), then the restaurant cuisine rule, then the parent label. FHRS: business type, then name hints.",
    "Guardrail: places of worship and religion are dropped (excluded), and halal/kosher never become a cuisine (custom_criteria.PEOPLE_*)."
  ],
